{"ID":"20240506102357-jn7ctlq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506102357-jn7ctlq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102357-jn7ctlq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102357-b03kua2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613100828-rxvpztf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:414,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613101222-4zh4i7t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:10,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"291荛花（黄芫花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240823142435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240629155414-gl0cexl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629155414-gl0cexl","updated":"20240629160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 334px;","style":"width: 324px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629155414-xsfwbb1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 324px;\" parent-style=\"width: 334px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 304px;","style":"width: 294px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629155425-tv5mp5n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 294px;\" parent-style=\"width: 304px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 309px;","style":"width: 299px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629155452-1k2mty4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 299px;\" parent-style=\"width: 309px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 293px;","style":"width: 283px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629155748-3wnm58p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 283px;\" parent-style=\"width: 293px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823140054-qu5zjmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823140054-qu5zjmu","updated":"20240823140141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 602px;","style":"width: 592px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花-20240823140054-err4d7e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 592px;\" parent-style=\"width: 602px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 583px;","style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花 1-20240823140141-b9xdtz0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\" parent-style=\"width: 583px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823141801-k4tsoft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823141801-k4tsoft","updated":"20240823142435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 865px;","style":"width: 855px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芫花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芫花-20240823141801-xkyuli4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 855px;\" parent-style=\"width: 865px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 335px;","style":"width: 325px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花4-20240629155537-m0bv75b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 325px;\" parent-style=\"width: 335px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823142226-wldh5fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823142226-wldh5fn","updated":"20240823142227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 556px;","style":"width: 546px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花 4-20240823142044-4scz8rz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 546px;\" parent-style=\"width: 556px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花 3-20240823142011-bzohb4r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823141927-rhgykq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823141927-rhgykq4","updated":"20240823141927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 700px;","style":"width: 690px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花 2-20240823141927-k8efu5q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 690px;\" parent-style=\"width: 700px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 523px;","style":"width: 513px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花 5-20240823142147-pbndq4c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 513px;\" parent-style=\"width: 523px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629155549-vxaog1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629155549-vxaog1i","updated":"20240823141330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花5-20240629155546-enyhbey.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花3-20240629155533-a0pv23h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240823142419-ayigim4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823142419-ayigim4","updated":"20240823142421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 849px;","style":"width: 839px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花2-20240629155529-vku6ete.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 839px;\" parent-style=\"width: 849px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荛花 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荛花 6-20240823142421-1rhggmt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240613100722-wyzho3f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100722-wyzho3f"}},{"ID":"20240613101053-ayxqyc4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101053-ayxqyc4","updated":"20240613101059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101053-nrbym4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101053-nrbym4c","updated":"20240613101053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101053-mw1rgzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101053-mw1rgzc","updated":"20240613101053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主伤寒温疟，下十二水，破积聚，大坚，症瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101053-rlrda1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101053-rlrda1m","updated":"20240613101053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生咸阳及河南中牟，六月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100722-50ok3ho","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100722-50ok3ho"}},{"ID":"20240613100902-4ge1z5c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100902-4ge1z5c","updated":"20240613100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100902-rxwdxva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100902-rxwdxva","updated":"20240613101033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦辛，寒，微寒，有毒。主伤寒，温疟，下十二水，破积聚，大坚症瘕，荡涤中留癖、饮食，寒热邪气，利水道，疗痰饮咳嗽。生咸阳川谷及河南中牟，六月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101210-nae7rbd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101210-nae7rbd"}},{"ID":"20240613101211-aqctnro","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101211-aqctnro","updated":"20240613101215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101211-8f7ln3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101211-8f7ln3s","updated":"20240613101211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今京、洛间甚多。张仲景《伤寒论》以荛花治利者，以其行水也。水去则利止，其意如此。然今人用时，当以意斟酌，不可使过与不及也。仍须是有是证者方可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101220-6tmrmmm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101220-6tmrmmm"}},{"ID":"20240613101222-4zh4i7t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101222-4zh4i7t","updated":"20240613101226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101222-mb37adz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101222-mb37adz","updated":"20240613101222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花猛力行水，破积聚大坚，瘕 顽痰，咳逆上气，更治咽喉内肿痛，消脐腹下癖气块。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101200-slantfm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101200-slantfm"}},{"ID":"20240613101202-2qfo1wj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101202-2qfo1wj","updated":"20240613101205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101202-eba0clu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101202-eba0clu","updated":"20240613101202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦、辛，微寒。有毒。能下十二经水，荡涤胸中邪癖。治咽喉肿痛，顽痰咳逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101202-qysbr5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101202-qysbr5t","updated":"20240613101202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒令赤色用。气血弱者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101149-22dhl1f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101149-22dhl1f"}},{"ID":"20240613101150-w7026rz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101150-w7026rz","updated":"20240613101155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101150-9xwqz8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101150-9xwqz8z","updated":"20240613101150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微寒，味苦、辛。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101150-c0lw8r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101150-c0lw8r8","updated":"20240613101150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主伤寒温疟，下十二水，破积聚大坚症瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖，饮食寒热邪气。利水道，疗痰饮咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101150-ad1qhsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101150-ad1qhsd","updated":"20240613101150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《衍义》云∶仲景以荛花治利者，以其行水也，水去则利止，其意如此。用时斟酌，不可太过与不及也。仍察其须有是证，方可用之。仲景小青龙汤∶若微利，去麻黄，加荛花，如鸡子，熬令赤色用之。盖利水也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101135-ce9ffii","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101135-ce9ffii"}},{"ID":"20240613101136-x3fu0ac","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101136-x3fu0ac","updated":"20240613101142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101136-xm30n3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101136-xm30n3h","updated":"20240613101136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦辛，寒，微寒，有毒。主伤寒，湿疟，下十二水，破积聚，大坚症瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖饮食、寒热邪气，利水道，疗痰饮，咳嗽。《药性论》云∶使。治咳逆上气，喉中肿满，疰气蛊毒， 癖气块，下水肿等。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101110-3dx24vh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101110-3dx24vh"}},{"ID":"20240613101111-hnhs8g2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101111-hnhs8g2","updated":"20240613101118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101111-sc704fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101111-sc704fh","updated":"20240613101111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小青龙汤若微利者去麻黄加荛花，盖利则水气不径趋膀胱，更以麻黄升太阳，则水道益涩，水气必泛而为胀满，太阴篇所谓下利清谷不可攻表汗出必胀满也。荛花本经主荡涤肠胃留癖利水道，则微利不至成滞下，而在上之水气亦去。且其用在花，走里兼能走表，故本经并主伤寒温疟饮食寒热邪气。若以茯苓泽泻治微利，则表邪亦从而陷之矣，此仲圣所以有取于荛花也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101124-2t1y0m9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101124-2t1y0m9"}},{"ID":"20240613101125-xy87mml","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101125-xy87mml","updated":"20240613101130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101125-922su5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101125-922su5p","updated":"20240613101125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平寒。主伤寒温疟。下十二水。破积聚大坚症瘕。荡涤肠胃中留癖饮食。寒热邪气。利水道。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101125-5dof41z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101125-5dof41z","updated":"20240613101125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小株丛簇。花茁繁饶。鲜荣黄湿。燥曝白飘。桃僵李代。莞毒名淆。雍州土沃。冈岭倾翘。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101125-2ndsrbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101125-2ndsrbm","updated":"20240613101125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍曰。小株花成簇。生荛者饶也。其花繁饶也。生时色黄。干则色白。或言无荛花。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101125-pqpw4yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101125-pqpw4yy","updated":"20240613101125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以桃花代之。取其利耳。古乐府。李树代桃僵。陶弘景曰。形似芫花。而极细。韩保升曰。以雍州者为上。生冈原上苗高二尺许。王融颂。葵藿微志徒倾翘。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101043-vbfmrke","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101043-vbfmrke"}},{"ID":"20240613101044-5jb5d7n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101044-5jb5d7n","updated":"20240613101049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101044-6fhq81u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101044-6fhq81u","updated":"20240613101044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大通，行水"}]},{"ID":"20240613101044-6840zpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101044-6840zpj","updated":"20240613101044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛散结、苦泄热，行水捷药，主治略同芫花。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100722-ewxg30a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100722-ewxg30a"}},{"ID":"20240613100723-1wnncy4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100723-1wnncy4","updated":"20240613100730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100723-wm9v2th","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100723-wm9v2th","updated":"20240613100723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、辛，寒、微寒，有毒。主治伤寒，温疟，下十二水，破积聚，大坚，症瘕。荡涤肠胃中留癖，饮食寒热邪气，利水道。治痰饮咳嗽。生咸阳川谷及河南中牟。六月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100723-8czuiyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100723-8czuiyi","updated":"20240613100723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中牟者，平时惟从河上来，形似芫花而极细，白色。比来隔绝，殆不可得。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100724-gse6nqa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100724-gse6nqa"}},{"ID":"20240613100738-slxzp65","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100738-slxzp65","updated":"20240613100744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100738-bq19rte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100738-bq19rte","updated":"20240613100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒，有毒。主治伤寒温疟，下十二水，破积聚，大坚症瘕，荡涤胸中留 饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。（荛音饶。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613100738-znydejm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100738-znydejm","updated":"20240613100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（荛花始出咸阳、河南、中牟，今所在有之，以雍州者为胜，苗似胡荽，茎无刺，花细黄色《诊要经终论》云∶五月六月，天气高，地气盛，人气在头。荛花气味苦寒，花开炎夏，禀阳之标阳，故苦寒有毒。伤寒者，寒伤太阳。荛花气合标阳，故治伤寒。温疟者，病藏于肾，荛花气禀寒水，故治温疟。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100738-ukyst9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100738-ukyst9b","updated":"20240613100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"膀胱水气藉太阳阳热而营运于周身，则外濡皮毛，内通经脉。水气不行，则为十二经脉之水。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100738-ysvareo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100738-ysvareo","updated":"20240613100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花合太阳之阳，故下十二水，且破类也。不但荡涤胸中留 ，且除饮食内停之寒热邪气。水气得阳热以营运，故利水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100738-26xu104","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100738-26xu104","updated":"20240613100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶《伤寒论》云∶伤寒表不解，心下有水气，干呕，发热而咳。若微利者，小青龙汤加荛花，如鸡子大，熬令赤色。大如鸡子，形圆象心也。熬令赤色，取意象火也。是荛花气味虽属苦寒，而有太阳之标阳，恐后世不能司岁备物，故加炮制如是尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100836-gcpzuoa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100836-gcpzuoa"}},{"ID":"20240613100838-gb2i28h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100838-gb2i28h","updated":"20240613100853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100838-0qctywt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100838-0qctywt","updated":"20240613100838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒，有毒。熬黄用，芫花叶尖如柳，花紫似荆，荛花苗茎无刺，花细色黄与芫花绝不相似，或言无荛花以芫花代之，性相近耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100838-kwdj8t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100838-kwdj8t3","updated":"20240613100838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主伤寒温疟，下十二经水，破积聚，大坚症瘕，荡涤胸中留癖饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100838-er83kwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100838-er83kwi","updated":"20240613100838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花苦辛，能破积聚症瘕，治痰饮咳逆，去咽喉肿闭。《本经》治伤寒温疟者，取苦寒以攻蕴积伏匿之邪也。言下十二经水，又治饮食寒热邪气者，以其苦寒峻利，饮食之邪亦得荡涤，而寒热自除也。仲景用此止利以行水，水去则利止矣。又小青龙汤云，若微利者，去麻黄加荛花，盖亦取其利水也。愚按∶芫花、荛花虽有辛温开表，苦寒走渗之不同，而破积逐水之功用仿佛。《本经》虽无芫花利水之说，而仲景十枣汤专行利水。是以药肆皆不辨混收，医家亦不辨混用。犹夫食谷得以疗饥，食黍亦可疗饥，混用可无妨碍。若矾石、石字形相类，药状亦相类，可不辨而混用耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100739-3smpszw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100739-3smpszw"}},{"ID":"20240613100755-934zr3k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100755-934zr3k","updated":"20240613100801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100755-cfsycld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100755-cfsycld","updated":"20240613100755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛，饶也。言其花开多也。味辛、苦，气寒，有毒。主伤寒，温疟，十二水肿，利水道，破积聚大坚瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖、饮食寒热邪气，疗痰饮咳嗽。仲景用治利者，以其行水也，水去则利止，量病斟酌用之。六月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100756-bjq3ro4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100756-bjq3ro4"}},{"ID":"20240613100806-olpzr71","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-olpzr71","updated":"20240613100811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荛花《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100806-9qkf52k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-9qkf52k","updated":"20240613100806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240613100806-uzzwtt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-uzzwtt8","updated":"20240613100806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100806-524n0p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-524n0p0","updated":"20240613100806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主伤寒温疟，下十二水，破积聚、大坚、症瘕，荡涤肠中留癖、饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100806-92mwwbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-92mwwbv","updated":"20240613100806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶荛花出咸阳川谷，及河南中牟，所在亦有，近以壅州者为好。苗似胡荽，高二尺，茎无刺。入夏作花，簇生细碎，生时色黄，干则缟白。或言世无荛花，每以芫花充用，不"}]},{"ID":"20240613100806-wu92me2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-wu92me2","updated":"20240613100806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶山海经云∶首山多荛，苗首出，萼随之，花落尽，叶乃茁也。故荛谐尧。尧，高也，广也，炎也，上也。高广承寒，炎上作苦，合配太阳化令，对待太阳体用药也。力主寒伤层署，表着六标暑巢营舍，因遇肃杀之秋风，或侵凄沧之水寒，或袭沐浴之水气，随卫入出，实虚更显，阴阳且移，休作成疟也。至下十二经水，破五脏积，六腑聚，大坚症，大坚瘕，留癖肠胃中者，荡涤无遗，空诸所有，捷于影响。若食饮馨饪，邪从口入者，或发于阴而寒，或发于阳而热，或寒热叠呈，而阴阳互迁者，陂可平，往可复，艰贞之吉，于食有福。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100806-zcrurqi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100806-zcrurqi"}},{"ID":"20240613100826-kl91zh7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-kl91zh7","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：荛花"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-hwovi3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-hwovi3l","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-qwe1uku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-qwe1uku","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ráo Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-pkhxp98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-pkhxp98","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-zgxbped","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-zgxbped","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 山皮条、白色矮陀陀、半边梅、竹腊皮、铁扇子"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-kttm2jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-kttm2jk","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-pgf18wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-pgf18wk","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瑞香科"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荛花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Wikstroemia canescens （Wall.）Meisn.，以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-qumzqrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-qumzqrd","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-dc1mfq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-dc1mfq7","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 云南、湖南、湖北、江西、陕西。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-w747c7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-w747c7y","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-9w8lt3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-9w8lt3n","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-wmxpgkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-wmxpgkn","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-9gh2449","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-9gh2449","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通经活络，祛风除湿，收敛。主治跌打损伤，筋骨疼痛，腮腺炎，乳腺炎，淋巴腺炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-1g2wgfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-1g2wgfb","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-fhp4scl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-fhp4scl","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-0uilrac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-0uilrac","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-72gkob7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-72gkob7","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-zbsby5x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-zbsby5x","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：荛花"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-ytf84e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-ytf84e2","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-eoi7yxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-eoi7yxe","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ráo Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-xvhmy1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-xvhmy1o","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-95rwnf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-95rwnf5","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-71hjqvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-71hjqvj","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-twnvpyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-twnvpyd","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为瑞香科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荛花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花朵"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-awri5p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-awri5p0","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-j73fjp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-j73fjp7","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山地石壁隙缝或山坡沟边较潮湿处，也有栽培者。分布湖南、湖北、陕西、江西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-2smm4zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-2smm4zh","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-dygfnnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-dygfnnh","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 落叶灌木，高30～90厘米，枝细长。小枝有丝状细毛。叶互生或对生，矩圆状披针形，长2.5～7.5厘米，宽1.5～2.5厘米，先端急尖，基部阔楔形，全缘，上面绿色，近无毛或疏生短柔毛，下面灰绿色，密生柔毛，叶脉隆起；叶柄长约3毫米，被细毛。花黄色，成顶生疏腋生穗状花序，或再合成圆锥花序，被细毛；无花瓣，花萼管长6～8毫米，先端4裂，裂片钝尖；花盘鳞片状线形；雄蕊2轮，花丝短；子房上位，花柱短，柱头球形。核果窄卵圆形，黑色，有丝状毛。花期5～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-3brh94u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-3brh94u","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-r7zijw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-r7zijw8","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草求真》:\"入肠胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-cf4lyd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-cf4lyd8","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-5iytljr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-5iytljr","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛苦，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-tacb9hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-tacb9hk","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-6159pwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-6159pwo","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"辛，微寒，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-09506dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-09506dv","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-bj0vn92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-bj0vn92","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体虚无积及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-k6mhzuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-k6mhzuz","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-llo4yc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-llo4yc5","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 泻水饮，破积聚。治留饮，咳逆上气，水肿，症瘕痃癖。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-wrbqk5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-wrbqk5b","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"主伤寒温疟，下十二水，破积聚、大坚症瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖、饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-9aj9gu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-9aj9gu1","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"疗痰饮咳嗽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-p86bqye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-p86bqye","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》:\"治咳逆上气，喉中肿满，痃癖气块，下水肿等。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-5iwl869","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-5iwl869","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-b13t14f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-b13t14f","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服:煎汤，0.8～1.5钱；或入丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-99ayv5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-99ayv5v","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-lgydlv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-lgydlv1","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治肿及支满澼饮:芫花、荛花各半两，甘草、大戟、甘遂、大黄、黄芩各一两，大枣十枚。上八味，细切，以水五升，煮成一升六合。分四服，空心服，以快下为度。（《千金方》干枣汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-nykgw1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-nykgw1k","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治腹中积聚邪气、寒气，消谷:甘遂一分，荛花一分，芫花一分，桂心一分，巴豆一分，杏仁一分，桔梗一分。上七味，荛花、芫花熬令香，巴豆、杏仁去皮熬令变色已，各异捣，下细筛，捣合丸，以白蜜捣万杵。服如小豆一丸，日三行，长将服之。伤寒增服，膈上吐，膈下利，小儿亦服，妇人兼身亦服。忌猪肉、芦笋、生葱。（《范汪方》捶凿丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-78owifa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-78owifa","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-k7in065","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-k7in065","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草衍义》:\"张仲景《伤寒论》以荛花治利者，以其行水也；水去则利止，其意如此。然今人用时，当以意斟酌，不可使过与不及也。仍须是有是证者方可用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-d9csvuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-d9csvuf","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草备要》:\"荛花，辛散结，苦泄热，行水捷药。主治略同芫花。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-4mhvb2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-4mhvb2d","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》:\"荛花，能破积聚症瘕，治痰饮咳逆，去咽喉肿闭。《本经》治伤寒温疟者，即苦寒以攻蕴积伏匿之邪也。言下十二经水，又治饮食寒热邪气者，以其苦寒峻利，饮食之邪亦得荡涤，而寒热自除也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-bvgtvmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-bvgtvmi","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草求真》:\"荛花虽与芫花形式相同，而究绝不相似，盖芫花叶尖如柳，花紫似荆，荛花苗茎无刺，花细色黄。至其性味，芫花辛苦而温，此则辛苦而寒。若论主治，则芫花辛温，多有达表行水之力；此则气寒，多有入里走泄之效，故书载能治利，然要皆属破结逐水之品，未可分途而别视也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-9i9hywb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-9i9hywb","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-k8uh9up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-k8uh9up","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-5ytcbk7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-5ytcbk7","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：荛花"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-tart9d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-tart9d8","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-z3qnnvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-z3qnnvv","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ráo Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-x9j89g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-x9j89g7","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-xr40dtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-xr40dtx","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 老龙树花、老虎麻花。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-185076m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-185076m","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-qoxhdkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-qoxhdkm","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Flower of Longflower Stringbush"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-s5hyuac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-s5hyuac","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-xzttqrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-xzttqrc","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《唐本草》：荛花，苗似胡荽，茎无刺，花细，黄色。四、五月收，与芫花全不相似也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-z2kkijh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-z2kkijh","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：荛花，盖亦芫花之类，气味主治大略相近。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-gss63hh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-gss63hh","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-vq13pke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-vq13pke","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为瑞香科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荛花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花蕾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-bxai9ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-bxai9ur","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Wikstroemia canescens (Wall.) Meissn. [Daphne canescens Wall.]"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-w653ycn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-w653ycn","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：5-6月花未开时采收，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-en0gze6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-en0gze6","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-d5neeud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-d5neeud","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于山地石壁隙缝或山坡沟边较潮湿外，也有栽培者。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-qk1uuql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-qk1uuql","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于陕西、江西、湖北、湖南、云南、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-0tfm89k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-0tfm89k","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-qt403vs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-qt403vs","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 荛花 落叶灌木，高30-90cm。枝细长，小枝有灰色或淡黄色柔毛，叶互生或对生；叶柄长约3mm，被柔毛；叶片长圆状披针形，长2.5-7.5cm，宽1.5-2.5cm，先端急尖，基部阔楔形，全缘，上面绿色，近无毛或疏生短柔毛，下面灰绿色，密生柔毛，叶脉隆起。花黄色，成顶生或腋生穗状花序，或再合成圆锥花序，被柔毛；花被管长6-8mm，先端4裂，裂片钝尖；花盘鳞片状线形；雄蕊8，二轮，花丝短，子房上位，花柱短，柱头球形。核果窄卵圆形，黑色，有丝状毛。花期5-6月，果期6-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-kyqvi8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-kyqvi8l","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-pzfwuxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-pzfwuxk","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 花冠黄色，穗花序顶生或腋生，被细毛，无花瓣，花颧管长6-8mm，先端4裂，裂片钝尖；花盘鳞片状线形。核果窄卵圆形，黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-07a5tl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-07a5tl4","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-dnuovui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-dnuovui","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-d3t4et5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-d3t4et5","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-0q1v7m8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-0q1v7m8","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；苦；性寒；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-n89912x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-n89912x","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-8v8dpnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-8v8dpnk","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体虚无积及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-ndzd3ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-ndzd3ra","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-dpxhq1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-dpxhq1q","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 泻水逐饮；消坚破积。主痰饮；咳逆上气；水肿；喉中肿满；症瘕痃癖"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-qn0x23d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-qn0x23d","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-22xgsfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-22xgsfp","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2.5-4.5g；或入丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-ociafng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-ociafng","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-hu13827","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-hu13827","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草衍义》：张仲景《伤寒论》以荛花治利者，以其行水也；水去则利止，其意如此。然今人用时，当以意斟酌，不可使过与不及也。仍须是有是证者方可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-avv70hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-avv70hw","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草备要》：荛花，辛散结，苦泄热，行水捷药。主治略同芫花。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-shigs2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-shigs2i","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》：荛花，能破积聚症瘕，治痰饮咳逆、去咽喉肿闭。《本经》治伤寒温疟者，即苦寒以攻蕴积伏匿之邪也。言下十二经水，又治饮食寒热邪气者，以其苦寒峻利，饮食之邪亦得荡涤，而寒热自除也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-j7q5niz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-j7q5niz","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草求真》：荛花虽与芫花形式相同，而究绝不相似，盖芫花叶尖如柳，花紫似荆，荛花苗茎无刺，花细色黄。至其性味，芫花辛苦而温，此则辛苦而寒。若论主治，则芫花辛温，多有达表行水之力；此则气寒，多有人里走泄之效，故书载能治利，然要皆属破结逐水之品，未可分途而别视也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-fnh3f19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-fnh3f19","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经》：主伤寒温疟，下十二水，破积聚、大坚症瘕，荡涤肠胃中留癖、饮食，寒热邪气，利水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-wlphwmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-wlphwmx","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《别录》：疗痰饮咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-7pp1dkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-7pp1dkp","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《药性论》：治咳逆上气，喉中肿满，疙瘩气块，下水肿等。"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-obmmlzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-obmmlzt","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613100826-eh6fz9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100826-eh6fz9s","updated":"20240613100826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613100827-pb7j20d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613100827-pb7j20d"}},{"ID":"20240613100828-rxvpztf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613100828-rxvpztf"}}]}